			"notes": "- One codebase for every supported version, built with Stonecutter: Minecraft 1.20.1 (Fabric, Forge), 1.21–1.21.1,\n  1.21.5, 1.21.6–1.21.8, 1.21.9–1.21.10, 1.21.11, 26.1–26.1.2, 26.2 and 26.3 (Fabric, NeoForge), and 1.21.4 (Fabric).\n- Fixed: crash on startup with Elytra Trims 4.9 (#1), which renamed a field this addon read.\n- Fixed: only one trim showing on elytras with Elytra Trims 4.9, which resolves trim textures at a different point.\n- If a future Elytra Trims changes its API again, elytras fall back to showing one trim instead of crashing the game.\n- Releases are published to Modrinth and CurseForge automatically from a version tag."
